    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy &amp; Security</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">ProKey is built to keep your typing private.\n\n• What you type is never stored, logged or sent anywhere.\n• This version has no INTERNET permission, no ads and no analytics.\n• The only data kept on your device is your keyboard settings.\n• The VIBRATE permission is used only for key vibration.\n• Word suggestions, clipboard history and a personal dictionary are not part of this version.</string>
